{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a386d1a17e866408","name":"T2-B Repulsor Tank","source":{"id":"source:reference-a386d1a17e866408","title":"T2-B Repulsor Tank","revision":20789,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:31:18Z","sha256":"109c635cdbe972d01df64ea78a48fc8ab7c7769d8119e1ceaf0cad79423049f4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20789","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=T2-B%20Repulsor%20Tank&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a386d1a17e866408","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Rebel acquisition of the modern T2-B Repulsor Tanks is a prime example of how ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}," obtains material from sympathetic corporate leaders. When the Alliance becomes aware that some of the top leadership at Yutrane-Trackata is not happy to be supplying a line of mining ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," and other heavy equipment exclusively to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", Rebel agents quickly broker a secret deal to purchase T2-B Tanks and other heavy war equipment. To protect the lives of the Rebel collaborators, each shipment is carefully orchestrated to appear to be the result of a Rebel raid.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Repulsor Tank features four linked rapid-fire ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Cannons"}," paired with advanced sensor arrays that make them highly accurate. However, the lightweight weaponry has difficulty piercing heavily armored Imperial units. The tank's sensors and fast speed allow it to be used as an armored reconnaissance unit, passing detailed sensor information to other units on the battlefield. It is also one of the few shielded ground units used by Rebellion forces. The Repulsor Tank holds a crew of three: a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Commander"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Commander","referenceId":"reference:16af7be312e1840b"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"},", and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"},". Because of the Rebellion's limited number of tanks, the Alliance rarely fields large formations of these Repulsor Tanks until after the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endor"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["T2-B Repulsor Tank Statistics (CL 7)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Huge ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +7; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 15 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://s